Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.3
Homepage: https://github.com/Sjord/checkmate
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: mpck
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: check MPEG audio files for errors
 Mpck scans MP3 files to verify that frames are where they are supposed
 to be, that frame headers are correct, and that headers are consistent
 throughout the file. It reports statistics such as bitrate and length,
 and gives a conclusion whether each file is good or bad.
